{
 "v": 3,
 "src_hash": "a3c7e659a00300ea",
 "duration": 945,
 "size": 7561761,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0.6,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "欢迎回来。今天是一条政治新闻，地点在德国的邻居，捷克。"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.96,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "上周日，布拉格有几十万人上街，抗议政府改革公共电视台和电台的经费制度。"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.93,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "现在，捷克的公共电视和广播，主要靠每个家庭每月交的一笔费用来维持，大约二百多克朗。政府打算取消这笔费用，改成直接从国家预算里拨钱，而且总额还要削减大约百分之十五。"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.5,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "批评的人担心：钱由政府直接给，政府就更容易控制媒体。游行的人举着牌子，英语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 46.4,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Hands off the media!"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.08,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语新闻里写的是："
  },
  {
   "start": 51.78,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Hände weg von den Medien!",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 57.03,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Hände weg von den Medien!",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 62.27,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Hände weg von den Medien!",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 66.16,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "别碰媒体！"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.73,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "开始之前，先复习上一期的两个词。同意、许可。"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.76,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "consent."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.03,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Einwilligung."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.91,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "处以罚款。"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.78,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "impose a fine."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.36,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "ein Bußgeld verhängen."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.75,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "今天学五个词。我们开始。"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.62,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第一个词。"
  },
  {
   "start": 102.89,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "rally."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.36,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "rally."
  },
  {
   "start": 107.74,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是集会、大规模的示威活动。名词动词都能用。做动词时，意思是聚集起来，表示支持或者反对。"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.61,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里，英语这样说："
  },
  {
   "start": 122.72,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Hundreds of thousands of people rallied in Prague on Sunday.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 129.69,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Hundreds of thousands of people rallied in Prague on Sunday.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 136.66,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Hundreds of thousands of people rallied in Prague on Sunday.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 141.82,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "几十万人周日在布拉格集会。"
  },
  {
   "start": 145.9,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语新闻最常用的词是："
  },
  {
   "start": 149.2,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Kundgebung."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.61,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这一句是："
  },
  {
   "start": 154.88,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "In Prag fand am Sonntag eine riesige Kundgebung statt.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 163.43,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "In Prag fand am Sonntag eine riesige Kundgebung statt.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 171.99,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "In Prag fand am Sonntag eine riesige Kundgebung statt.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 178.35,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "周日，布拉格举行了一场规模巨大的集会。"
  },
  {
   "start": 183.63,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "前半部分的意思是告诉大家、公开宣布。所以，德语的集会，字面上就是：大家聚在一起，公开说出自己的意见。顺便一提，德语里游行也常说："
  },
  {
   "start": 199.53,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Demo."
  },
  {
   "start": 202.58,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "生活里，这个英语词还有一个常见意思：重新振作、反弹。比如股市回升："
  },
  {
   "start": 211.57,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Stocks rallied after the news.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 216.41,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Stocks rallied after the news.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 221.24,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Stocks rallied after the news.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 224.82,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "消息出来后，股市反弹了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 228.41,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：一大群人从四面八方，重新聚到同一个广场上。聚起来，就是这个词。"
  },
  {
   "start": 237.92,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 240.19,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "a huge rally."
  },
  {
   "start": 245.59,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "eine riesige Kundgebung."
  },
  {
   "start": 252.31,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第二个，是一个词组。"
  },
  {
   "start": 255.37,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "public broadcaster."
  },
  {
   "start": 258.42,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "public broadcaster."
  },
  {
   "start": 261.37,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是公共广播机构，也就是靠公共资金、不属于政府也不属于私人老板的电视台和电台。英国广播公司就是最有名的例子。"
  },
  {
   "start": 274.51,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "这个词组的后半部分来自一个动词："
  },
  {
   "start": 278.65,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "broadcast."
  },
  {
   "start": 280.92,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是广播、播出。"
  },
  {
   "start": 284.13,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语里这是一个你在德国每天都会碰到的词："
  },
  {
   "start": 288.97,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "öffentlich-rechtlich."
  },
  {
   "start": 292.71,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "字面意思是：依照公法设立的。德国的公共广播就叫："
  },
  {
   "start": 299.08,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der öffentlich-rechtliche Rundfunk."
  },
  {
   "start": 304.39,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德国第一电视台和第二电视台，都属于这一类。"
  },
  {
   "start": 309.73,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里："
  },
  {
   "start": 311.9,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Critics fear the plan will weaken the independence of public broadcasters.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 320.51,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Critics fear the plan will weaken the independence of public broadcasters.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 329.11,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Critics fear the plan will weaken the independence of public broadcasters.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 335.5,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "批评的人担心，这个计划会削弱公共广播的独立性。"
  },
  {
   "start": 341.66,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Kritiker fürchten um die Unabhängigkeit der öffentlich-rechtlichen Sender.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 351.01,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Kritiker fürchten um die Unabhängigkeit der öffentlich-rechtlichen Sender.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 360.36,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Kritiker fürchten um die Unabhängigkeit der öffentlich-rechtlichen Sender.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 367.3,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "批评的人担心公共广播电视台的独立性。"
  },
  {
   "start": 372.46,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆小技巧：后半部分，原本是农民把种子往田里大把撒出去的动作，撒得又宽又广。电台把声音撒向所有人，就是广播。"
  },
  {
   "start": 385.97,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 388.24,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "public broadcaster."
  },
  {
   "start": 393.69,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "öffentlich-rechtlich."
  },
  {
   "start": 400.04,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第三个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 402.31,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "licence fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 405.0,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "licence fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 407.58,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是执照费，在这里专指每家每户交给公共广播的那笔钱。英国就叫这个名字。新闻里也常说："
  },
  {
   "start": 418.78,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "broadcasting fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 421.68,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 423.86,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Rundfunkgebühr."
  },
  {
   "start": 427.6,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "你在德国交的那笔，现在的正式名称其实是："
  },
  {
   "start": 432.75,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der Rundfunkbeitrag."
  },
  {
   "start": 436.9,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "就是每个月寄信来让你交钱的那个。两个词的区别是：一个是按使用收的费，一个是每户都要交的分摊。"
  },
  {
   "start": 447.88,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里，捷克政府的计划是："
  },
  {
   "start": 451.69,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The government wants to scrap the licence fee and pay for public media from the state budget.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 461.64,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The government wants to scrap the licence fee and pay for public media from the state budget.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 471.58,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The government wants to scrap the licence fee and pay for public media from the state budget.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 478.98,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "政府想取消广播费，改用国家预算来养公共媒体。"
  },
  {
   "start": 485.22,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Regierung will die Rundfunkgebühren abschaffen und die Sender aus dem Staatshaushalt finanzieren.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 497.11,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Regierung will die Rundfunkgebühren abschaffen und die Sender aus dem Staatshaushalt finanzieren.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 509.0,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Regierung will die Rundfunkgebühren abschaffen und die Sender aus dem Staatshaushalt finanzieren.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 517.86,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "政府想取消广播费，改由国家预算资助电视台和电台。"
  },
  {
   "start": 524.68,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "这里还有两个顺带的词。取消、废除，英语口语常说："
  },
  {
   "start": 531.36,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "scrap."
  },
  {
   "start": 533.63,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 535.8,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "abschaffen."
  },
  {
   "start": 538.83,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "国家预算，德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 541.84,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der Staatshaushalt."
  },
  {
   "start": 545.78,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：每个月信箱里那封来要钱的信。在德国它叫这个名字，在英国叫那个名字，在捷克，政府想把它取消。"
  },
  {
   "start": 558.6,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 560.87,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "the licence fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 566.03,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der Rundfunkbeitrag."
  },
  {
   "start": 572.58,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第四个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 574.85,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "overhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 577.32,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "overhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 579.7,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "注意：做名词时，重音在前面。"
  },
  {
   "start": 583.91,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "an OVERhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 586.28,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "做动词时，重音在后面。"
  },
  {
   "start": 589.72,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "to overHAUL."
  },
  {
   "start": 592.22,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是彻底检修、全面改革。不是小修小补，而是拆开重来。"
  },
  {
   "start": 600.06,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语可以说："
  },
  {
   "start": 602.23,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "grundlegend umbauen."
  },
  {
   "start": 606.34,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "前面这个词意思是从根基上，后面这个词意思是改建。也可以说："
  },
  {
   "start": 614.08,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Reform."
  },
  {
   "start": 617.27,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里："
  },
  {
   "start": 619.44,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The plan would overhaul the way public media are funded.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 626.36,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The plan would overhaul the way public media are funded.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 633.29,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The plan would overhaul the way public media are funded.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 638.42,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "这个计划会彻底改变公共媒体的经费方式。"
  },
  {
   "start": 643.66,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Regierung will die Finanzierung der Medien grundlegend umbauen.",
   "rep": 1
  },
  {
   "start": 652.74,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Regierung will die Finanzierung der Medien grundlegend umbauen.",
   "rep": 2
  },
  {
   "start": 661.82,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Regierung will die Finanzierung der Medien grundlegend umbauen.",
   "rep": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 668.57,
   "l": "zh",
